/T (Pakistan is home to a population of ~241 million, with an annual growth rate of 2.55%. Of this population, 61.18% live in rural areas, while the remaining 38.82% reside in urban areas. Reportedly, there are approximately 19.2 million housing units in Pakistan with ~38 million households and an average household size of approximately 6.3. Among these, 68% consist of 1-2 rooms \(small homes\), 24.43% consist of 3-4 rooms \(mid-sized homes\), and only 6.92% consist of 5 or more rooms \(large homes\). This distribution indicates that the demand for small homes is significantly higher across Pakistan.)
