/T (The property market in Peshawar has experienced varying growth trends across different segments over the past years. Overall, the market has demonstrated notable growth, particularly for medium-sized properties, which achieved the highest cumulative returns over both 6-year and 3-year periods \(64% and 63% respectively\). Small properties also exhibited strong performance, with a cumulative return of 61% over 6 years, although their returns declined in 2023. Large properties experienced the most volatile returns, fluctuating between a -9% decrease in 2016 and a 28% increase in 2022, resulting in lower cumulative returns compared to both small and medium properties over the long term.)
