277 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (Sialkot, a prominent industrial city with a population of 4.5 million, is renowned for its manufacturing prowess, particularly in the sports goods and surgical instruments industries. The city has approximately 672,000 households, with an average household size of 6.7. Sialkot's property market reflects its strong economic base, with consistent growth across all property segments and a notable surge in demand for smaller, affordable housing options. The city's dynamic real estate landscape supports its robust industrial sector while catering to the housing needs of its diverse and growing population.)
/E (Sialkot, a prominent industrial city with a population of 4.5 million, is renowned for its manufacturing prowess, particularly in the sports goods and surgical instruments industries. The city has approximately 672,000 households, with an average household size of 6.7. Sialkot's property market reflects its strong economic base, with consistent growth across all property segments and a notable surge in demand for smaller, affordable housing options. The city's dynamic real estate landscape supports its robust industrial sector while catering to the housing needs of its diverse and growing population.)
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
278 0 obj
<<
