/T (Property price data, sourced from zameen.com, was analyzed for various cities across Pakistan. Due to the differing frequencies of data availability per city, return calculations for small, medium, and large properties were based on the segments where data existed for all three categories. This resulted in some returns being calculated over 10 years, others over 9 years, and some over as little as 3 years.)
